Use Feedback to replenish yourself.  This heals you for [286, 385, 461, 527, 584 (TL1-5; MP 100)] life, and restores [28, 38, 46, 52, 58 (TL1-5; MP 100)] stamina, [51, 69, 83, 94, 105 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mana, [42, 57, 69, 79, 87 (TL1-5; MP 100)] equilibrium, [28, 38, 46, 52, 58 (TL1-5; MP 100)] vim, [14, 19, 23, 26, 29 (TL1-5; MP 100)] positive and negative energies, [20, 26, 32, 36, 40 (TL1-5; MP 100)] psi energy, and [7, 9, 11, 13, 14 (TL1-5; MP 100)] hate.

The heal and resource gain will improve with your Mindpower.
